  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8cf72940f56fa4944b96a056293a7297, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcTalking: 
  _lines:
  - The director wants me to use nails to mark Figure attributes...
  - The motion is almost like an icepick lobotomy...I've only spectated one once,
    and that already made me feel sick.
  - I guess I'll have to be quick with the nails.
  - I'll also need to interrogate them about potential attributes before marking,
    seeing as its a permanent mark...
  - Judging by the large pile the director provided, they intend for me to mark as
    many attributes as I can.
  - The director also wants me to finalize my identification status of the patient
    at the end of the examination, once I'm sure I've marked all attributes.
  - I wonder what he will do with the Figures.
  - Anyways, this patient, Galatea, looks normal from the front, so I guess I'll
    check her back for any attributes.
  - I best be thorough and follow through with the procedure.
  - ...
  _nextNode: []
  examNext: 0
